<title>ALGERIA: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Algeria, Feb 1, Algiers - during the last two weeks, 15 to 20 vessels at anchorage awaiting berths. Average time on roads about three or four days. --</p>
</text>
